Obu
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF

GIOM 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GIOM 9 FACE_ALL
GIOM 2 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
DEST Empty
MOVE GIOM COLUMN
DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK GIOM GIOM
OR
    DEST Rank K
    AND
        DEST Rank K
        DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK COLUMN GIOM
DEST Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
$win
PILE ALL GIOM Empty
